  "body": "Several projects use our changelog and add checkboxes in front of each item to track their support for that release. We can probably make this easier with a `https://spec.matrix.org/v1.9/checklist.md` sort of thing.\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/16709\r\n* https://github.com/ruma/ruma/issues/1626\r\n\r\nI'd suggest we go with doing something similar to Ruma's template - individual projects can edit the template further if they choose (like how Synapse does it).",
